These are sample package definitions for Redhat-based OSs. And a pip thing. The
pip stuff was written 100% by Claude. It is a terrible system, and I strongly
recommend you use the Debian packages instead

Debian-based OSs already have mrcal in their repositories; the mrcal Debian git
repo is here:

https://salsa.debian.org/science-team/mrcal

See the documentation for details:

https://mrcal.secretsauce.net/install.html
